@guide A_Felwood
@name Felwood (Talonbranch Glade)
@faction Alliance
@levels 51-54
@zone Felwood
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Emerald Sanctuary, Jaedenar, the corrupted moonwells and Talonbranch Glade.
@next A_BurningSteppes

accept Forces of Jaedenar | Greta Mosshoof, Emerald Sanctuary.
accept Verifying the Corruption | Taronn Redfeather.
accept Cleansing Felwood | Arathandris Silversky.
accept The Corruption of the Jadefire | Eridan Bluewind.
complete Forces of Jaedenar | Jaedenar cultists.
turnin Forces of Jaedenar
accept Collection of the Corrupt Water
complete Collection of the Corrupt Water | Fill the vessel at the corrupted moonwell in Jaedenar.
turnin Collection of the Corrupt Water
accept Seeking Spiritual Aid
complete Verifying the Corruption | Explore the area north of Shatter Scar Vale.
turnin Verifying the Corruption
complete The Corruption of the Jadefire | Jadefire satyrs at Jadefire Glen.
turnin The Corruption of the Jadefire
accept Further Corruption
complete Further Corruption | Xavathras, Jadefire Glen.
turnin Further Corruption
complete Cleansing Felwood | Cenarion Plant Salve - gather from Felwood.
turnin Cleansing Felwood
fp Talonbranch Glade
accept Timbermaw Ally | Grazle, Timbermaw Hold area.
accept Deadwood of the North | Nafien.
complete Deadwood of the North | Deadwood furbolgs in northern Felwood.
turnin Deadwood of the North
turnin Timbermaw Ally
level 54
train
note Seeking Spiritual Aid continues in Winterspring - optional. Fly to Ironforge, then to Morgan's Vigil in the Burning Steppes.
